[
{"index": 1, "translated_text": "[A1][/A1]名称 (NAME)"},
{"index": 2, "translated_text": "pthread_self — 获取调用线程的线程 ID (get the calling thread ID)"},
{"index": 3, "translated_text": "[A2][/A2]简介 (SYNOPSIS)"},
{"index": 4, "translated_text": "[CODE3]"},
{"index": 5, "translated_text": "[A4][/A4]描述 (DESCRIPTION)"},
{"index": 6, "translated_text": "[I5]pthread_self[/I5]() 函数应返回调用线程的线程 ID。"},
{"index": 7, "translated_text": "[A6][/A6]返回值 (RETURN VALUE)"},
{"index": 8, "translated_text": "[I7]pthread_self[/I7]() 函数应始终成功，并且不保留任何返回值来指示错误。"},
{"index": 9, "translated_text": "[A8][/A8]错误 (ERRORS)"},
{"index": 10, "translated_text": "未定义错误。"},
{"index": 11, "translated_text": "[A9][/A9]示例 (EXAMPLES)"},
{"index": 12, "translated_text": "无。"},
{"index": 13, "translated_text": "[A10][/A10]应用用法 (APPLICATION USAGE)"},
{"index": 14, "translated_text": "无。"},
{"index": 15, "translated_text": "[A11][/A11]理由 (RATIONALE)"},
{"index": 16, "translated_text": "[I12]pthread_self[/I12]() 函数提供了与进程的 [A13][I14]getpid[/I14]()[/A13] 函数类似的能力，理由也相同：创建调用不会向所创建的线程提供线程 ID。"},
{"index": 17, "translated_text": "[A15][/A15]未来方向 (FUTURE DIRECTIONS)"},
{"index": 18, "translated_text": "无。"},
{"index": 19, "translated_text": "[A16][/A16]参见 (SEE ALSO)"},
{"index": 20, "translated_text": "[A17][I18]pthread_create[/I18]()[/A17], [A19][I20]pthread_equal[/I20]()[/A19]"},
{"index": 21, "translated_text": "XBD [A21][I22]&lt;pthread.h&gt;[/I22][/A21]"},
{"index": 22, "translated_text": "[A23][/A23]变更历史 (CHANGE HISTORY)"},
{"index": 23, "translated_text": "首次在 Issue 5 中发布。为与 POSIX 线程扩展保持一致而纳入。"},
{"index": 24, "translated_text": "[A24][/A24]第 6 版 (Issue 6)"},
{"index": 25, "translated_text": "[I25]pthread_self[/I25]() 函数被标记为 Threads 选项的一部分。"},
{"index": 26, "translated_text": "[A26][/A26]第 7 版 (Issue 7)"},
{"index": 27, "translated_text": "应用了 Austin Group Interpretation 1003.1-2001 #063，更新了 RETURN VALUE 部分。"},
{"index": 28, "translated_text": "[I27]pthread_self[/I27]() 函数从 Threads 选项移至 Base。"},
{"index": 29, "translated_text": "&nbsp;"}
]
